# NO LINE-ENDING CONVERSION ON ANALYTICAL ARTIFACTS.
# An earlier version declared "*.csv text", which makes Git normalise line
# endings on checkout. On a Windows clone every CSV arrives with CRLF, its bytes
# differ from what SOURCE_MANIFEST.md hashed, and all 53 checksums fail on a
# correct repository. Verified by cloning with core.autocrlf=true. These files
# are byte-exact evidence and must not be rewritten by the transport.
*.csv -text
*.json -text
*.txt -text

# Documents and binaries: never converted.
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary

# Source and prose: LF everywhere, so scripts behave identically on any platform.
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
